q 0.04 0.16 0.32 rg 0 808 595 34 re f Q
BT /F2 8 Tf 1 1 1 rg 1 0 0 1 42 820 Tm (SAHAYAK | SIMPLE LANGUAGE GUIDE) Tj ET
BT /F2 18 Tf 0.04 0.16 0.32 rg 1 0 0 1 42 777.00 Tm (SAHAYAK Presentation Guide) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 747.00 Tm (Himanxhu V Ghimire) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.08 0.23 0.38 rg 1 0 0 1 42 727.00 Tm (Role: Live Demo, Testing and Conclusion) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 715.00 Tm (Suggested speaking time: 4 to 5 minutes, plus the demo) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 692.90 Tm (Your job in the presentation) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 675.90 Tm (You are the final speaker. Show the live website if it is working. Explain how to test the system) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 663.80 Tm (    fairly, tell the judges about its limits and future improvements, and finish the presentation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 651.70 Tm (    Prepare a backup in case the camera, internet or server fails.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 629.60 Tm (Slide 12 - Introduce the demo) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 612.60 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 599.50 Tm (Thank you. I will show how someone can try the SAHAYAK prototype. I will explain what we should) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 587.40 Tm (    look for and how to judge its result. This project is still a prototype, so the demo can show) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 575.30 Tm (    both what it can do and where it may fail.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 558.20 Tm (Before starting, make sure the audience can see the screen. Ask permission before using another) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 546.10 Tm (    person's image or recording them.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 524.00 Tm (Live demo - step by step) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 507.00 Tm (1. Open the SAHAYAK website and choose Live Studio.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 493.90 Tm (2. Check the internet and confirm that the backend is responding.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 480.80 Tm (3. Allow camera access when the browser asks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 467.70 Tm (4. Put your hands clearly inside the camera view and wait for the hand-point overlay.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 454.60 Tm (5. Make a sign that appears in the active model label list. Hold or move as required by) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 442.50 Tm (    the mode.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 429.40 Tm (6. Point to the predicted label on the screen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 416.30 Tm (7. Try another supported sign and, when possible, one older sign.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 403.20 Tm (8. If a result is wrong, say so honestly. Check the lighting and hand position once, then) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 391.10 Tm (    continue.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 369.00 Tm (What to explain during the demo) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 352.00 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 338.90 Tm (The points drawn over the hand are landmarks found by the browser. The website changes them into) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 326.80 Tm (    numbers and sends the numbers to the backend. The trained model returns a predicted label, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 314.70 Tm (    the website displays it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 297.60 Tm (One or two correct results are only a demonstration. They cannot tell us the overall accuracy. To) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 285.50 Tm (    measure reliability, we need many repeated tests using examples that were kept separate from) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 273.40 Tm (    training.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 251.30 Tm (Backup plan if the demo fails) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 234.30 Tm (- If the camera does not start, check browser permission and whether another app is using) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 222.20 Tm (      the camera.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 209.10 Tm (- If the backend does not respond, say the prediction service is unavailable. Do not claim) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 197.00 Tm (      it made a prediction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 183.90 Tm (- If the hand points appear but the label is wrong, explain that hand tracking and sign) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 171.80 Tm (      prediction are separate stages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 158.70 Tm (- If internet is unavailable, explain that live backend prediction and some translation or) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 146.60 Tm (      speech features need a connection.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 133.50 Tm (- If the demo still does not work, show the homepage or workflow diagram and talk through) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 121.40 Tm (      the steps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 104.30 Tm (You can say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 91.20 Tm ("The live result depends on camera detection and the hosted backend. We have a prototype, and this) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 79.10 Tm (    is a good example of why testing reliability matters. I will explain the workflow while we) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 67.00 Tm (    check the connection.") Tj ET
q 0.78 0.82 0.87 RG 42 44 m 553 44 l S Q
