stream
q 0.04 0.16 0.32 rg 0 808 595 34 re f Q
BT /F2 8 Tf 1 1 1 rg 1 0 0 1 42 820 Tm (SAHAYAK | SIMPLE LANGUAGE GUIDE) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 780.00 Tm (Slide 13 - How should we test it?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 763.00 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 749.90 Tm (We should try each sign many times and record which results are right and wrong. Some test) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 737.80 Tm (    examples should come from people or recording sessions that were not used during training. We) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 725.70 Tm (    should test different lighting, camera angles, distances, hand positions and movement speeds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 708.60 Tm (Results for each sign can show which signs are hard for the model to tell apart. Response speed) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 696.50 Tm (    should be measured separately. A fast result can still be wrong.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 674.40 Tm (Slide 14 - Limits and safe use) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 657.40 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 644.30 Tm (The current model recognizes only a limited set of trained labels. It does not understand all ISL) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 632.20 Tm (    sentences, face expressions, body movement or language rules. The hand detector can fail when) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 620.10 Tm (    the hands are hidden, outside the frame or in poor light.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 603.00 Tm (SAHAYAK is not a guaranteed communication service or a replacement for an interpreter. Training) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 590.90 Tm (    examples should be collected with permission, stored carefully and kept separate from fair) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 578.80 Tm (    test examples.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 556.70 Tm (Slide 15 - Future improvements) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 539.70 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 526.60 Tm (Future work includes collecting more varied examples with permission, adding signs only after) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 514.50 Tm (    training and testing, improving moving-sign recognition, reporting results for every label,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 502.40 Tm (    and testing the website with people who use ISL. We also need clear privacy information and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 490.30 Tm (    better error messages.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 468.20 Tm (Final conclusion) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 451.20 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 438.10 Tm (To conclude, SAHAYAK shows how a camera, hand-point detection, machine learning and a website can) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 426.00 Tm (    work together. It is a starting point, not a finished universal translator. Useful assistive) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 413.90 Tm (    technology needs good data, fair testing, user feedback, privacy care and honest reporting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 401.80 Tm (    Thank you for listening. We welcome your questions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 379.70 Tm (Questions judges may ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 362.70 Tm (Q: What happens when the model is wrong?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 349.60 Tm (A: We record the mistake and investigate the camera conditions and model result instead of hiding) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 337.50 Tm (    it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 320.40 Tm (Q: Does the full website work offline?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 307.30 Tm (A: No. Live backend prediction and some translation or speech services need a connection.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 290.20 Tm (Q: How can the model improve?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 277.10 Tm (A: Collect more varied labelled examples, test on fresh data, inspect mistakes and retrain only) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 265.00 Tm (    after checking the candidate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 247.90 Tm (Q: What is its accuracy?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 234.80 Tm (A: We should give a percentage only if we have a saved report from a fair test. Otherwise, we) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 222.70 Tm (    should say that the accuracy has not been properly measured yet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 205.60 Tm (Q: How do we protect privacy?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 192.50 Tm (A: Ask for camera permission, explain what is sent or saved, get permission for training samples) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 180.40 Tm (    and avoid keeping unnecessary personal data.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 158.30 Tm (Before the judges arrive) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 141.30 Tm (- Open the homepage and Live Studio.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 128.20 Tm (- Check camera permission and internet access.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 115.10 Tm (- Check that the backend is responding and the models are loaded.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 102.00 Tm (- Check the current label list and test one or two supported signs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 88.90 Tm (- Make sure the hands are visible and the room is well lit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 75.80 Tm (- Keep a backup slide or workflow picture ready.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 62.70 Tm (- Never invent accuracy numbers.) Tj ET
